 corr=[["Studies prove that social media harms teenagers.","Studies suggest that social media may harm teenagers.",["Studies prove that social media may harms teenagers.","Studies suggests that social media may harm teenagers.","Studies suggest that social media harms may teenagers."],"Hedged claim."],["Teenagers tends to spend more time online.","Teenagers tend to spend more time online.",["Teenagers are tending to spend more time online.","Teenagers tending to spend more time online.","Teenagers tend spend more time online."],"Plural subject."],["It is argue that homework is useless.","It is argued that homework is useless.",["It argues that homework is useless.","It is arguing that homework is useless.","It is argues that homework is useless."],"Passive."],["This policy is likely fail.","This policy is likely to fail.",["This policy is likely failing.","This policy is likely to fails.","This policy is likely for fail."],"<i>likely to</i>."]],
